# Flutter Project Rules - BLoC/Cubit + Repository + GoRouter + Dio

## Core Architecture Principles
- Follow BLoC pattern with Cubit for state management
- Implement Repository pattern for data layer abstraction
- Use GoRouter for declarative routing
- Use Dio for HTTP client with interceptors
- Follow clean architecture principles with clear layer separation
- Implement dependency injection with get_it or provider

## Project Structure
```
lib/
├── core/
│   ├── constants/
│   ├── errors/
│   ├── network/
│   ├── theme/
│   └── utils/
├── data/
│   ├── datasources/
│   ├── models/
│   └── repositories/
├── domain/
│   ├── entities/
│   ├── repositories/
